- **#11–#15 (§12):** the persona ruler rule R9 checks §12 against canon hash `0195b993` (a ruler run printed "§12 canon 0195b993"). packages/hr/src/fixtures.ts:65 and the canonical text in spec §4.1 must move with any §12 edit.
